js=[[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"hyphen\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"comma\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"em dash\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"comma\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"en dash\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"low\"],[\"en dash\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"nothing\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"hyphen\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"comma\",\"low\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"raised dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"],[\"baseline dot\",\"high\"]]
with open('answers.jsonl','w') as f:
 for r,(m,c) in zip(rows,js):
  f.write(json.dumps(dict(item_id=r['item_id'],answer=next(k for k,v in r['options'].items() if v==m),confidence=c,note=''))+'\\n')
a=[json.loads(l) for l in open('answers.jsonl')]
assert len(a)==len(rows)==86
for r,b in zip(rows,a):
 assert r['item_id']==b['item_id']
 assert b['answer'] in r['options']
 assert b['confidence'] in ['high','low']
 assert set(b)=={'item_id','answer','confidence','note'}
print('Validated count, order, and option letters:',len(a))
print(json.dumps(dict(collections.Counter(r['options'][b['answer']] for r,b in zip(rows,a))),sort_keys=True))
print('Low confidence:',sum(b['confidence']=='low' for b in a))
